LLM_TERMINATE_COMMANDS="${LLM_TERMINATE_COMMANDS:-再见,拜拜,小浦再见,小浦拜拜,你退下吧,退下吧,没有问题了,我没有问题了,没问题了,不用了,先这样,结束对话,关闭交互,结束交互,退出交互,bye,bye bye,goodbye,see you,that is all,thats all,nothing else,no more question,no more questions,no more problem,no more problems,i have no more questions,i have no more problems}"
